# Build and install output for this package only.
#
# The repo is public and the root .gitignore does not yet cover node_modules or
# dist, so this covers what belongs to packages/web. The root-level gap is
# reported rather than patched here: the workspace root is another package's to
# change, and a second agent editing the same .gitignore is how one of the two
# edits quietly disappears.
node_modules/
dist/
.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo
